  "abstract": "This paper gives a typed realization dictionary for Modal Triplet Theory. In the canonical physical specialization M10=Y4 x X6, coordinate factors of the compact internal space, vector bundles, Hermitian line bundles, vertical operators, and spectral projectors are distinct objects. We prove the joint-projector theorem under strong commutation and the discrete-spectrum theorem under compact resolvent. We record the exact local world-in-world decomposition Mat(3,R)=so(3)+(1+2+3) strain components and distinguish it from the selected q=79 global carrier L_shared tensor (O+A0+A). Equality of ranks does not construct the required connection-, operator-, and Hessian-preserving continuum intertwiner. The shared circle is line-bundle phase and holonomy data, not physical time or a seventh internal dimension. The old no-global-chart, automatic discrete-spectrum, forced extended-carrier, worldsheet, and duality claims are withdrawn. The invalid old Iwasawa construction and literal Circle-Lens-Nil product are quarantined. Realization nonuniqueness is proved to limit physical predictivity until a source law selects one realization and supplies its dynamics and observable map.",
